BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ANEW Place Sixth Annual Celebration of Trees
DTSTART:20261213T100000
DTEND:20261213T190000
DTSTAMP:20261127T200316Z
UID:66ed9a7b374e594488742ad16023d0@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:ANEW Place is excited to announce the return of its signature 
 holiday fundraising event\, the Sixth Annual Celebration of Trees\, beginn
 ing Black Friday\, November 27\, at 9:00 a.m. at University Mall in South 
 Burlington. The event will welcome visitors seven days a week through Dece
 mber 13 in the former Spirit Halloween space\, just down the hall from San
 ta. The festive holiday tradition features beautifully decorated Christmas
  trees and themed gift packages generously donated by local businesses\, c
 hurches\, organizations\, community members\, and friends of ANEW Place. V
 isitors can enjoy Christmas music\, browse the displays\, and purchase tic
 kets for a chance to win a decorated tree and all the gifts displayed on a
 nd beneath it. Over the past five years\, Celebration of Trees volunteers
 \, sponsors\, and supporters have helped raise more than $245\,000 to supp
 ort ANEW Place’s mission of serving adults experiencing homelessness in 
 Chittenden County. Thanks to the generosity of our cash sponsors\, buying 
 a raffle ticket is a fun\, simple way for the community to join ANEW Place
  in helping someone find their way home. We’re grateful to every cash sp
 onsor and tree donor who makes this event possible. Special thanks go to o
 ur Premier Sponsor\, Vermont Mortgage Company\, media sponsors 95 Triple X
  and ABC22/FOX44\, and University Mall for donating the event space.\n\nSo
 urces: Vermont Public
LOCATION:University Mall\, 155 Dorset Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/anew-place
 -sixth-annual-celebration-of-trees-06-11-2026-21-02-46
END:VEVENT
